    summary: "本篇安全公告（DSA-6466-1）針對 Samba 服務中的一個資訊洩漏（Information Leakage）漏洞進行了修補。該漏洞可能允許攻擊者在特定條件下，透過網路協議的交互作用，竊取系統或記憶體中的敏感資料。雖然原文未提供具體的 CVSS 分數、受影響版本範圍或確切的攻擊向量細節，但這類資訊洩漏通常代表著潛在的權限提升或資料偵察風險。Debian 建議所有使用 Samba 服務的用戶應立即更新到修補後的版本以降低風險。使用者應特別注意檢查其部署環境中是否運行了 Samba 的相關組件，並遵循 Debian 官方提供的升級指引進行系統維護。",
    tags: ["Debian", "Samba", "DSA-6466-1", "資訊洩漏", "安全更新"],
    title_en: "Debian Releases Security Advisory: Patching Information Leakage Vulnerability in Samba (DSA-6466-1)",
    summary_en: "This security advisory (DSA-6466-1) addresses an Information Leakage vulnerability within the Samba service. This vulnerability could potentially allow an attacker, under specific conditions, to steal sensitive data from the system or memory through network protocol interactions. Although the original advisory does not provide specific CVSS scores, affected version ranges, or precise attack vector details, such information leakage typically indicates potential privilege escalation or data reconnaissance risks. Debian recommends that all users utilizing the Samba service immediately update to the patched version to mitigate risk. Users should pay special attention to checking if Samba components are running in their deployment environment and follow the official Debian upgrade guidelines for system maintenance.",
