    id: "20260825-021",
    trackers: ["eu_cra", "security"],
    category: "法規與標準",
    title: "歐盟《網路韌性法案》（CRA）要求深入解析：揭示北美科技業對史上最嚴格資安規範的普遍不知情",
    summary: "本篇內容討論了歐洲聯盟（EU）的《網路韌性法案》（Cyber Resilience Act, CRA），該法案將適用於所有在歐盟市場銷售、包含數位元件（如軟體和韌體）的產品。根據報告指出，全球及北美科技產業普遍對此嚴格資安規範缺乏了解，這構成了巨大的合規風險。\n\n演講深入探討了維護「私有分支」（private forks）所隱藏的高昂成本，並區分了軟體製造商（manufacturer）與開源資源管理者（open source steward）之間的關鍵法律差異。Red Hat提出了「冠軍式管理」（champion stewardship）的框架作為解決方案。\n\n對於面臨即將到來的漏洞報告平台啟動和最終強制執行的組織，本內容提供了具體的合規步驟與行動指南，旨在協助企業達到合規、協作且安全的狀態。",
    tags: ["EU CRA", "網路韌性法案", "Red Hat", "Open Source", "資安規範", "合規性"],
    title_en: "Deep Dive into the EU Cyber Resilience Act (CRA): Exposing North American Tech Industry's General Ignorance of the Toughest Cybersecurity Regulations Ever",
    summary_en: "This article discusses the European Union's Cyber Resilience Act (CRA), which will apply to all products sold on the EU market that contain digital components (such as software and firmware). The report indicates that there is a general lack of awareness of these strict cybersecurity regulations across the global and North American tech industries, posing significant compliance risks.\n\nThe presentation deeply explored the high hidden costs associated with maintaining \"private forks,\" and delineated the critical legal differences between a software manufacturer and an open source steward. Red Hat proposed a framework called \"champion stewardship\" as a solution.\n\nFor organizations facing the imminent launch and eventual mandatory enforcement of vulnerability reporting platforms, this content provides specific compliance steps and action guidelines, aiming to help businesses achieve a compliant, collaborative, and secure state.",
    tags_en: ["EU CRA", "Cyber Resilience Act", "Red Hat", "Open Source", "Cybersecurity Regulations", "Compliance"],
    sources: [
      { name: "OpenSSF Blog", url: "https://openssf.org/podcast/2026/08/25/whats-in-the-soss-podcast-70-s3e22-private-forks-cra-deadlines-and-the-true-cost-of-open-source-compliance-with-dave-russo", lang: "EN" }
    ]
