    summary_en: "This article reports a warning issued by Microsoft, noting that users may encounter operational difficulties and instability when attempting to convert or integrate existing Excel workbooks into environments utilizing the new Exchange connector. These issues primarily involve data format compatibility, and the challenges of bridging the gap between the connector interface and established workflows. Although the article does not provide specific CVE IDs or CVSS scores, the practical impact is that users may be unable to smoothly access or edit workbook data containing complex data structures. It is recommended that relevant enterprise users and system administrators closely monitor subsequent official guidance and best practices published by Microsoft. Specifically, when performing large-scale workflow migrations, thorough pre-testing and validation should be conducted to ensure data integrity and business continuity.",
