    category: "Windows",
    title: "PowerToys 新增「Window Hopper」功能，讓 Windows 11 用戶能更高效切換單一應用程式的多個視窗",
    summary: "本文介紹 PowerToys 套件中的新功能 Window Hopper，旨在解決傳統 Alt+Tab 切換多個應用程式視窗時，無法專注於單一應用程式內部多個獨立視窗的問題。當用戶同時開啟多個相同應用程式的視窗（例如多個 Edge 瀏覽器或 Windows Terminal）時，Alt+Tab 會將焦點分散到所有已開啟的應用程式上。\nWindow Hopper 的運作方式是提供一個類似 Alt+Tab 的疊層介面，但它僅顯示並允許用戶循環切換來自單一特定應用程式的所有視窗。這使得用戶能更精準地找到和聚焦於所需的特定窗口。\n使用方法為：從 Microsoft Store 下載並安裝 PowerToys，進入「Windowing & Layout」區塊啟用 Window Hopper 功能。預設快捷鍵為 Alt + Backtick（`），但可自訂其他組合鍵。此功能對於需要同時處理多個瀏覽器視窗、終端機會話或檔案總管實例的用戶極具實用性。",
    tags: ["PowerToys", "Window Hopper", "Windows 11", "Alt+Tab", "多工處理"],
    title_en: "PowerToys adds 'Window Hopper' feature, allowing Windows 11 users to switch between multiple windows of a single application more efficiently",
    summary_en: "This article introduces Window Hopper, a new feature within the PowerToys suite. It aims to solve the problem of being unable to focus on multiple independent windows within a single application when using the traditional Alt+Tab method to switch between multiple application windows. When users have multiple windows of the same application open (for example, multiple Edge browser instances or Windows Terminal), Alt+Tab disperses focus across all open applications.\n\nWindow Hopper operates by providing a layered interface similar to Alt+Tab, but it only displays and allows the user to cycle through all windows belonging to a single specific application. This allows users to locate and focus on the desired window with greater precision.\n\nTo use it: Download and install PowerToys from the Microsoft Store, and enable the Window Hopper feature in the 'Windowing & Layout' section. The default shortcut is Alt + Backtick (`) but can be customized. This feature is extremely useful for users who need to handle multiple browser windows, terminal sessions, or File Explorer instances simultaneously.",
    tags_en: ["PowerToys", "Window Hopper", "Windows 11", "Alt+Tab", "Multitasking"],
