    category: "Apple",
    title: "Apple iOS 27預計於九月發布，搭載新功能涵蓋錢包、相簿與Siri AI大改版",
    summary: "本文報導指出下一代主要行動作業系統為 iOS 27，預計將在今年九月中期向公眾用戶發布。根據 Apple 近年來大型 iOS 版本（如 iOS 16、iOS 17、iOS 18）的發布時間規律，分析推測 iOS 27 的正式上線日期可能落在九月十四日左右。\n\niOS 27 本身預計將帶來多項新功能升級，涵蓋如 Apple Wallet（錢包）、Photos（相簿）、Messages（訊息）和 Notes（備忘錄）等應用程式的更新，此外還會為 CarPlay 和 AirPods 提供升級。特別值得關注的是 Siri AI 將進行重大改動。\n\n該系統更新將與 iOS 26 相容，支援所有受 iOS 26 支持的 iPhone 型號。雖然文章未提供具體漏洞或安全資訊，但預計在蘋果年度新品發表會期間（通常提前一週）會有更正式的日期公布。",
    tags: ["iOS 27", "Apple", "iPhone", "macOS", "Siri AI"],
    title_en: "Apple iOS 27 expected to launch in September, featuring major updates to Wallet, Photos, and Siri AI",
    summary_en: "This article reports that the next major mobile operating system will be iOS 27, expected to be released to the public in mid-September this year. Based on the release schedule of Apple's recent major iOS versions (such as iOS 16, iOS 17, and iOS 18), analysis suggests that the official launch date for iOS 27 may fall around September 14th.\n\niOS 27 itself is expected to bring multiple new feature upgrades, covering updates to applications such as Apple Wallet, Photos, Messages, and Notes. Furthermore, it will provide upgrades for CarPlay and AirPods. Of particular note is the major overhaul planned for Siri AI.\n\nThis system update will be compatible with iOS 26 and will support all iPhone models supported by iOS 26. Although the article does not provide specific vulnerabilities or security information, a more formal date is expected to be announced during Apple's annual product launch event (usually one week prior).",
    tags_en: ["iOS 27", "Apple", "iPhone", "macOS", "Siri AI"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Mac", url: "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/25/ios-27-release-date-when-next-major-iphone-update-is-coming", lang: "EN" }
    ]
