    title: "Apple 發布新一代 Mac mini 與 Mac Studio，搭載 M6 及 M5 Ultra 晶片",
    summary: "本文報導 Apple 最新發布的 Mac mini 和 Mac Studio 系列產品線。本次更新重點包括更強大的 M6 和 M5 Ultra 新型晶片，提供提升效能與更多 AI 優化功能的新配置選項。使用者現在已可以在 Amazon 等平台預購這些新設備。\n\n具體機型包含搭載 M6 及 M5 Pro 晶片的 Mac mini，以及搭載 M5 Max 與 M5 Ultra 的 Mac Studio。文章列出了多款不同規格的 Mac mini 型號及其價格，例如 2026 Mac mini M6 16GB/256GB 定價 $899。\n\n此外，Apple 也更新了 Magic Keyboard 等周邊配件，這些產品同樣可在 Amazon 或 Best Buy 購買。本報導主要為新品發布與市場銷售資訊，並未提及任何安全漏洞或修補建議。",
    tags: ["Apple", "Mac mini", "Mac Studio", "M6", "M5 Ultra", "晶片"],
    title_en: "Apple Releases New Mac mini and Mac Studio with M6 and M5 Ultra Chips",
    summary_en: "This article reports on the latest Mac mini and Mac Studio product lines released by Apple. Key highlights of this update include the more powerful M6 and M5 Ultra chips, offering new configurations with enhanced performance and more AI optimization features. Users can now pre-order these new devices on platforms like Amazon. The specific models include the Mac mini equipped with M6 and M5 Pro chips, and the Mac Studio equipped with M5 Max and M5 Ultra. The article lists multiple Mac mini models with different specifications and their prices, such as the 2026 Mac mini M6 16GB/256GB priced at $899. Additionally, Apple has updated peripheral accessories like the Magic Keyboard, which are also available for purchase on Amazon or Best Buy. This report primarily covers new product releases and market sales information, and does not mention any security vulnerabilities or patch recommendations.",
