    summary: "蘋果公司宣布更新一代Mac mini，這是近兩年來首次升級。新機型保留了緊湊的設計，但透過引入全新的M6和M5 Pro配置，實現了顯著的性能飛躍。基礎配置採用M6晶片，這款為蘋果首款2nm製程處理器，具備12核心CPU（包含2個Super cores、4個Performance cores和6個Efficiency cores），相較於M4可提供高達40%更快的多執行緒性能。此外，M6首次引入了雙16核心Neural Engine，使AI性能提升最高達4倍。\n更高階的M5 Pro Mac mini則具備更強大的配置，支援高達64GB統一記憶體和307GB/s頻寬。新Mac mini在連接埠方面升級至Wi-Fi 7、藍牙6，並標準配備2.5Gb Ethernet。\n入門款M6起價為$899，而M5 Pro型號則從$1,699開始售價。這批更新強調了AI運算能力和多核心處理效能的提升。",
    tags: ["Mac mini", "Apple", "M6", "M5 Pro", "2nm", "Neural Engine"],
    title_en: "Apple Unveils New Mac mini: Featuring M6 and M5 Pro Chips for Significant Boost in AI and Multi-Core Performance",
    summary_en: "Apple has announced an updated generation of the Mac mini, marking its first upgrade in nearly two years. While retaining its compact design, the new model achieves a significant performance leap by introducing the brand-new M6 and M5 Pro configurations. The base model utilizes the M6 chip, Apple's first 2nm process processor, featuring a 12-core CPU (including 2 Super cores, 4 Performance cores, and 6 Efficiency cores). Compared to the M4, it offers up to 40% faster multi-threaded performance. Furthermore, the M6 introduces dual 16-core Neural Engines, boosting AI performance by up to four times. The higher-end M5 Pro Mac mini features a more powerful configuration, supporting up to 64GB of unified memory and 307GB/s bandwidth. Connectivity has been upgraded with Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 6, and standard 2.5Gb Ethernet. The entry-level M6 starts at $899, while the M5 Pro model begins at $1,699. This update emphasizes enhanced AI computing capabilities and multi-core processing power.",
    tags_en: ["Mac mini", "Apple", "M6", "M5 Pro", "2nm", "Neural Engine"],
