    category: "Apple",
    title: "駭客利用偽造 OpenAI Codex 廣告，透過 Mac 惡意軟體進行攻擊",
    summary: "本篇文章報導了網路安全領域的最新威脅：攻擊者正在散播偽裝成 OpenAI Codex 的廣告，以此作為載體植入針對 macOS 作業系統的惡意軟體。這類釣魚式攻擊旨在欺騙使用者點擊看似正規的廣告或連結，進而讓設備感染惡意程式。雖然原文未提供具體的 CVE 編號、CVSS 分數或受影響版本資訊，但其實務影響極為嚴重，可能導致用戶資料外洩、系統被劫持或進行其他網路犯罪活動。資安專業人員應提高警覺心，特別注意來源不明的軟體下載和廣告連結，並建議使用者保持 macOS 作業系統及相關應用程式的更新狀態，以降低遭受惡意攻擊的風險。",
    tags: ["macOS", "OpenAI Codex", "惡意軟體", "釣魚攻擊", "資安威脅"],
    title_en: "Hackers Utilize Fake OpenAI Codex Ads to Launch macOS Malware Attacks",
    summary_en: "This article reports on a recent cybersecurity threat: attackers are distributing advertisements disguised as OpenAI Codex to embed malware targeting the macOS operating system. This type of phishing attack aims to deceive users into clicking on seemingly legitimate ads or links, thereby infecting their devices with malicious code. Although the original text does not provide specific CVE IDs, CVSS scores, or affected version information, the practical impact is extremely severe, potentially leading to user data leakage, system hijacking, or other cybercrime activities. Cybersecurity professionals should heighten their vigilance, paying special attention to unknown software downloads and ad links, and advising users to keep their macOS operating system and related applications updated to mitigate the risk of malicious attacks.",
