    category: "Android",
    title: "Nothing OS 5.0 (基於 Android 17) 更新亮點：新增 AI 功能、UI 優化與 Glyph 控制中心",
    summary: "Nothing 公司宣布 Nothing OS 5.0，這是一個基於 Android 17 的重大系統更新。該版本預計從十月開始逐步推送，並帶來多項介面優化和新功能。主要亮點包括：全系統 UI 字體更新、Pixel 風格的透明/模糊效果應用於主畫面小工具及 Nothing Gallery 等應用；新增「Away Time」等個人化小工具，以及專用的 Glyph 應用程式來控制燈光功能。\n在 AI 功能方面，引入了 Essential Voice 的即時文字預覽、自動分類內容的「Smart Collections」，並允許用戶透過手機內建 App 建構 Essential Apps。此外，系統還增加了黃色 AI 隱私指示器和 Noto 3D emoji 支持。Nothing OS 5.0 將首先推送給 Phone (3) 型號，其他支援設備將在隨後時間點逐步更新。",
    tags: ["Nothing OS 5.0", "Android 17", "AI 功能", "UI 更新", "Glyph", "Pixel"],
    title_en: "Nothing OS 5.0 (Based on Android 17) Highlights: New AI Features, UI Enhancements, and Glyph Control Center",
    summary_en: "Nothing has announced Nothing OS 5.0, a major system update based on Android 17. This version is expected to begin rolling out starting in October and introduces multiple interface optimizations and new features. Key highlights include: a system-wide UI font update, and the application of Pixel-style transparency/blur effects to home screen widgets and applications like Nothing Gallery. New personalized widgets, such as \"Away Time,\" and a dedicated Glyph application for controlling the lighting function have been added. Regarding AI capabilities, the update introduces Essential Voice's real-time text preview, \"Smart Collections\" for automatically categorizing content, and allows users to build Essential Apps using the phone's built-in app. Furthermore, the system adds a yellow AI privacy indicator and support for Noto 3D emoji. Nothing OS 5.0 will initially be rolled out to the Phone (3) model, with other supported devices receiving updates at later times.",
