    category: "前瞻技術",
    title: "WhatsApp 升級帳號安全機制：支援多重 Passkey 與強化密碼驗證",
    summary: "Meta 公司宣布更新 WhatsApp 的帳戶安全功能，旨在提升用戶在 iOS 和 Android 設備上的登入安全性。此次主要更新包括新增對「多個 Passkeys」的支援，讓用戶可以為單一帳號綁定多種防釣魚認證方式。此外，WhatsApp 也將原本的六位 PIN 碼升級為完整的密碼選項，要求更長的、包含字母數字和特殊字元的複雜密碼，以強化兩步驟驗證（Two-step verification）層級。\n\n除了 Passkeys 和密碼強化外，Android 用戶在接聽電話時也將獲得更多上下文資訊，例如來電來源地、是否為聯絡人以及雙方是否有共同群組等。WhatsApp 表示，這些額外的資訊能幫助用戶在面對詐騙電話時，有更充裕的時間進行判斷。\n\n用戶可透過「設定 > 帳號 > Passkeys」管理其認證金鑰。Meta 的此系列安全升級顯示了對提升用戶帳戶防盜和抗釣魚能力的重視。",
    tags: ["WhatsApp", "Passkey", "兩步驟驗證", "密碼強化", "多裝置登入"],
    title_en: "WhatsApp Account Security Upgrade: Support for Multiple Passkeys and Enhanced Password Verification",
    summary_en: "Meta announced updates to WhatsApp's account security features, aiming to improve user login safety on both iOS and Android devices. The major updates include adding support for 'multiple Passkeys,' allowing users to link various anti-phishing authentication methods to a single account. Furthermore, WhatsApp is upgrading the existing six-digit PIN to a full password option, requiring a longer, more complex password that includes letters, numbers, and special characters, thereby strengthening the Two-step verification layer.\n\nBeyond Passkeys and password enhancement, Android users will also receive more contextual information when receiving calls, such as the call's origin, whether the caller is a contact, and if the two parties share a common group. WhatsApp stated that this additional information helps users have more time to assess potential scam calls.\n\nUsers can manage their authentication keys via 'Settings > Account > Passkeys.' Meta's series of security upgrades demonstrates its commitment to enhancing user account theft prevention and anti-phishing capabilities.",
    tags_en: ["WhatsApp", "Passkey", "Two-step verification", "Password enhancement", "Multi-device login"],
