    summary: "本文為Mandiant的服務介紹，旨在協助企業提升整體網路安全韌性。其提供的服務涵蓋範圍廣泛，包括但不限於：進行「滲透測試」和「紅隊演練」，模擬真實威脅行為來找出系統弱點；執行「資安評估」（Cyber Defense Assessment），建立具備預測性的防禦中心；提供「供應鏈安全」與「雲端架構審計」，確保多雲環境的資料保護；此外，服務也包含「事件應變（Incident Response）」、危機溝通管理以及將威脅情報轉化為可執行的商業決策。這些專業服務旨在幫助組織從被動的事故反應模式，轉型為主動預防和戰略規劃的資安體系。",
    tags: ["Mandiant", "事件應變", "滲透測試", "紅隊演練", "雲端安全", "威脅情報"],
    title_en: "Mandiant Service Overview: Comprehensive Cybersecurity Incident Response, Risk Assessment, and Defense Enhancement Solutions",
    summary_en: "This article provides an overview of Mandiant's services, designed to help enterprises enhance their overall cybersecurity resilience. The services offered are comprehensive, including but not limited to: conducting 'penetration testing' and 'red team exercises' to simulate real-world threats and identify system vulnerabilities; performing 'Cyber Defense Assessments' to establish predictive defense centers; providing 'supply chain security' and 'cloud architecture audits' to ensure data protection across multi-cloud environments. Furthermore, the services encompass 'Incident Response,' crisis communication management, and transforming threat intelligence into actionable business decisions. These professional services aim to help organizations transition from a reactive incident response model to a proactive, strategic cybersecurity system.",
