    tags: ["Mandiant", "紅隊評估", "雲端安全", "資安事件應對", "風險管理", "Google SecOps"],
    title_en: "Mandiant Service Overview: Comprehensive Cybersecurity Incident Response, Risk Assessment, and Defense Capability Enhancement Solutions",
    summary_en: "This article serves as a service catalog from Mandiant, designed to help enterprises elevate their overall cybersecurity maturity. The core services offered span from proactive threat hunting (Compromise Assessment) to strategic crisis communication management. Specific technical support includes conducting Red Team Assessments, which simulate real attacker behavior to identify defensive blind spots; executing cloud architecture assessments to ensure configuration security across multi-cloud environments like AWS, Azure, and Google Cloud; and providing integration and optimization services for specific security platforms (such as Google SecOps). Mandiant emphasizes translating complex security risks into business language understandable by senior management, enabling companies to view cybersecurity investment as a strategic enabler for business innovation. Clients are advised to utilize these professional resources to establish a predictive, mission-oriented Cyber Defense Center and conduct regular stress testing to strengthen overall resilience.",
    tags_en: ["Mandiant", "Red Team Assessments", "Cloud Security", "Incident Response", "Risk Management", "Google SecOps"],
