    summary_en: "This article introduces the comprehensive cybersecurity consulting and incident response services provided by Mandiant. These services cover everything from Incident Response to strategic crisis communication, as well as proactive Threat Hunting. Clients can secure flexible and immediate expert support through a Mandiant Retainer, ensuring rapid response during unforeseen events.\n\nSpecific services include: conducting security assessments to identify potential vulnerabilities; executing Red Team Assessments, which simulate real-world threat behaviors to uncover defensive blind spots; performing architectural security audits for cloud environments (such as AWS, Azure, and Google Cloud) to fix common misconfigurations; and providing integration and optimization services for the Google SecOps platform.\n\nFurthermore, Mandiant assists enterprises in translating complex cybersecurity risks into business language understandable by senior executives, thereby elevating cybersecurity into a strategic driver for business innovation. These recommendations help organizations transition from a reactive incident response model to a predictive, mission-driven security operations center.",
