    summary_en: "This article is a service introduction from Mandiant, rather than a report on a single vulnerability or attack incident. It covers complete cybersecurity lifecycle management, aiming to help organizations enhance overall resilience and strategic defense capabilities. Key services include: conducting 'compromise assessments' to find evidence of past or ongoing intrusions; providing 'red team assessments' that simulate real attacker behavior to uncover complex attack paths missed by traditional assessments; executing 'cloud architecture assessments' to ensure secure configurations across environments like AWS, Azure, and Google Cloud, thereby reducing the attack surface. Furthermore, Mandiant offers consulting services that translate cybersecurity risks into business decisions, helping senior executives convert network threats into actionable business strategies. These services aim to transition enterprises from reactive incident response to a predictive, mission-oriented 'cyber defense center,' ultimately achieving a balance between cybersecurity capability and business innovation.",
    tags_en: ["Mandiant", "Red Team Assessments", "Cloud Architecture Assessments", "Incident Response", "Risk Management", "Cybersecurity"],
