    category: "重點關注",
    title: "WhatsApp升級帳號安全功能：支援多個Passkey與字母數字密碼，強化防盜機制",
    summary: "Meta透過更新宣布了多項提升WhatsApp帳號安全的重大功能。首先，WhatsApp現已支持為同一帳戶設定多個passkey，這對於同時使用iOS和Android設備的用戶極具便利性。此外，其兩步驟驗證（two-step verification）功能也大幅升級，從原有的六位PIN碼擴展至支援包含特殊字元的完整字母數字密碼。\n\n除了帳號保護機制外，WhatsApp還為Android用戶新增了針對未知來電的防詐騙功能。當接到未儲存聯絡人撥打的電話時，系統將提供更多資訊，例如該號碼是否來自不同國家或是否有共同群組，幫助用戶判斷是否接聽。\n\n值得注意的是，iPhone用戶可利用Apple在iOS 26上提供的「通話篩選（Call Screening）」功能，雖然此功能不適用於WhatsApp通話，但能自動要求未知來電者說明姓名和來電原因。這些更新旨在為用戶提供更全面的安全保護層級。",
    tags: ["WhatsApp", "Meta", "Passkey", "兩步驟驗證", "Android", "iOS 26"],
    title_en: "WhatsApp enhances account security with support for multiple Passkeys and alphanumeric passwords",
    summary_en: "Meta announced several major updates to enhance WhatsApp account security. Firstly, WhatsApp now supports setting multiple passkeys for a single account, which is highly convenient for users who use both iOS and Android devices. Furthermore, its two-step verification feature has been significantly upgraded, expanding from the original six-digit PIN to support full alphanumeric passwords including special characters.\n\nBeyond account protection, WhatsApp has introduced a fraud prevention feature for Android users targeting unknown calls. When receiving a call from an unsaved contact, the system provides more information, such as whether the number originates from a different country or if there is a shared group, helping users determine whether to answer.\n\nNotably, iPhone users can utilize Apple's 'Call Screening' feature, available in iOS 26. Although this feature does not apply to WhatsApp calls, it automatically prompts unknown callers to state their name and the reason for the call. These updates aim to provide users with a more comprehensive layer of security protection.",
    tags_en: ["WhatsApp", "Meta", "Passkey", "Two-Step Verification", "Android", "iOS 26"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Mac", url: "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/25/whatsapp-announces-three-ways-to-make-accounts-more-secure", lang: "EN" }
    ]
