    title: "Anthropic 更新 Claude 功能：統一 Cowork 與 Chat 的記憶體功能，提升用戶體驗",
    summary: "資安公司 Anthropic 發布更新，旨在整合其 AI 聊天產品 Claude Cowork 和 Claude Chat 之間的「記憶體」（Memory）功能。此項變動的實質意義是讓兩個系統能夠共享相同的上下文和歷史資訊，使用戶無需重複解釋背景資料，能更順暢地接續對話。\n\nAnthropic 強調，預設情況下，Claude 不會將健康、信仰等敏感主題儲存到記憶體中。然而，用戶可以在「Memory settings」中手動開啟此功能以記錄這些主題。該記憶體功能已支援 Free、Pro 和 Max 等不同付費方案，並可在 Web、桌面端（如 Mac）和行動裝置（iOS/Android）上使用。\n\n用戶若想獲得最新更新，建議在 iOS 和 Android 設備上將相關 App 更新至最新版本。",
    tags: ["Anthropic", "Claude", "Memory", "AI 模型", "上下文學習"],
    title_en: "Anthropic Updates Claude Features: Unifying Memory Functionality Across Cowork and Chat for Enhanced User Experience",
    summary_en: "Cybersecurity firm Anthropic has released an update designed to integrate the 'Memory' function between its AI chat products, Claude Cowork and Claude Chat. The core significance of this change is that both systems can now share the same context and historical information, allowing users to continue conversations more smoothly without having to repeatedly explain background details.\n\nAnthropic emphasized that, by default, Claude will not store sensitive topics such as health or beliefs in the Memory. However, users can manually enable this feature in the 'Memory settings' to record such subjects. This Memory functionality is supported across various paid plans, including Free, Pro, and Max, and is available on Web, desktop (such as Mac), and mobile devices (iOS/Android).\n\nUsers who wish to receive the latest updates are advised to update the relevant apps to the latest version on their iOS and Android devices.",
