    title: "Apple 推出「50 種輔助功能」指南，協助年長用戶更輕鬆使用設備",
    summary: "蘋果公司（Apple）在慶祝成立五十週年之際，特別針對年齡較長的用戶群體，發布了一份包含「50 種輔助功能」（accessibility）的指南。這項舉措旨在提升使用者介面（UI）的易用性與可及性。這些功能涵蓋了從調整 Apple Watch 的文字大小，到讓 iPhone 能夠提醒洗衣機循環是否完成等生活情境應用。總體而言，蘋果透過強化輔助功能設定，使設備能更貼近年長用戶的生活需求，提升整體使用體驗。",
    tags: ["Apple", "輔助功能", "Accessibility", "使用者介面", "UI/UX"],
    title_en: "Apple launches '50 Accessibility Features' guide to help older users use devices more easily",
    summary_en: "To celebrate its 50th anniversary, Apple released a guide featuring '50 accessibility' functions specifically targeting older user demographics. This initiative aims to enhance the usability and accessibility of the user interface (UI). These features cover a range of life-scenario applications, from adjusting text size on the Apple Watch to allowing the iPhone to remind users when a washing machine cycle is complete. Overall, by strengthening accessibility settings, Apple enables devices to better meet the daily needs of older users, thereby improving the overall user experience.",
