    title: "OpenAI CEO Sam Altman：人工智慧仍待「iPhone時刻」，需從Apple學到關鍵教訓",
    summary: "OpenAI 執行長 Sam Altman 表示，人工智慧（AI）的發展目前仍處於等待一個類似 iPhone 產品發布的黃金時期。他承認自己過度樂觀地預估了 AI 對經濟的顛覆速度。Altman 指出，雖然科技會帶來巨大的變革，但這也將為那些尚未採用 AI 技術的企業創造新的商業機會。整體而言，他認為業界需要更務實的視角來評估 AI 的市場導入時程與實際應用價值。",
    tags: ["OpenAI", "Sam Altman", "人工智慧", "Apple", "科技趨勢"],
    title_en: "OpenAI CEO Sam Altman: AI Still Awaits Its 'iPhone Moment,' Needs Key Lessons from Apple",
    summary_en: "OpenAI CEO Sam Altman stated that the development of Artificial Intelligence (AI) is currently awaiting a golden period similar to the launch of an iPhone product. He admitted that he had been overly optimistic in predicting the speed at which AI would disrupt the economy. Altman pointed out that while technology will bring massive changes, this also creates new business opportunities for companies that have not yet adopted AI technology. Overall, he believes the industry needs a more pragmatic perspective to assess the market adoption timeline and practical value of AI.",
