    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Sifive 推動開發伺服器採用 RISC-V 架構，加速資料中心運算轉型",
    summary: "本篇報導指出 Sifive 公司正在積極推動將 RISC-V 架構整合到其開發伺服器中。RISC-V 是一種開源的指令集架構（ISA），近年來受到業界高度關注，特別是在追求更開放、更具成本效益的運算基礎設施方面。透過採用此架構，企業可以建立更客製化、更能滿足特定工作負載需求的資料中心解決方案。這項趨勢代表著產業正在從傳統的專有晶片供應鏈轉向更分散、可自定義的硬體生態系統。對於資安和開發人員而言，了解 RISC-V 的應用不僅是技術追蹤，更是掌握未來計算資源佈局與安全彈性設計的重要指標。",
    tags: ["RISC-V", "Sifive", "資料中心", "開源硬體", "ISA"],
    title_en: "Sifive Promotes Adoption of RISC-V Architecture in Development Servers, Accelerating Data Center Computing Transformation",
    summary_en: "This report highlights that Sifive is actively promoting the integration of the RISC-V architecture into its development servers. RISC-V is an open-source Instruction Set Architecture (ISA) that has garnered significant industry attention in recent years, particularly in the pursuit of more open and cost-effective computing infrastructure. By adopting this architecture, enterprises can build more customized data center solutions that meet specific workload requirements. This trend represents the industry's shift from traditional proprietary chip supply chains toward a more decentralized and customizable hardware ecosystem. For cybersecurity professionals and developers, understanding RISC-V's applications is not merely a technical pursuit, but a crucial indicator for grasping the future layout of computing resources and secure resilience design.",
