    title: "國內企業與駭客社群在DEF CON 34展示AI主題競賽，深化全球資安技術交流",
    summary: "本報導指出韓國安全公司 SecurityHub 與駭客社群 HSPACE 共同參與了在全球網路安全盛會 DEF CON 34。他們不僅是參觀者，更主動擔任內容生產者角色，設計並運營了名為「HSPACE: AI Battlegrounds」的官方競賽。\n這場競賽的核心概念是利用自然語言提示（Prompt）讓參與者創建自定義角色，再由AI根據這些提示來決定角色的能力。它從傳統尋找正確答案的方式轉變為觀察AI判斷過程、並透過修改提示進行競爭，著重於「提示工程」（Prompt Engineering）和人機互動。\n此外，該聯合團隊的年輕駭客們在多個專業展區也表現出色，包括遊戲駭客和量子運算展區獲得第二名；汽車安全展區則以第五名參賽。這顯示了韓國資安社群不僅能參與國際盛會，更能將本土技術與內容推向全球舞台，並持續擴大這種跨界合作模式。",
    tags: ["DEF CON 34", "SecurityHub", "HSPACE", "AI Battlegrounds", "提示工程", "駭客社群"],
    title_en: "Domestic Companies and Hacker Communities Showcase AI-Themed Competition at DEF CON 34, Deepening Global Cybersecurity Exchange",
    summary_en: "This report highlights that the South Korean security company SecurityHub and the hacker community HSPACE jointly participated in the global cybersecurity event DEF CON 34. They were not merely attendees but actively served as content producers, designing and operating an official competition called \"HSPACE: AI Battlegrounds.\" The core concept of this competition involves participants creating customized characters using natural language prompts, which are then used by AI to determine the characters' abilities. This shifts the focus from traditional question-and-answer formats to observing the AI's judgment process and competing by modifying prompts, emphasizing \"Prompt Engineering\" and human-computer interaction. Furthermore, the young hackers from this joint team performed well in multiple professional exhibition areas, including securing second place in the Game Hacking and Quantum Computing exhibition areas, and fifth place in the Automotive Security exhibition area. This demonstrates that the Korean cybersecurity community is not only capable of participating in international events but can also push local technology and content onto the global stage, continuously expanding this cross-industry collaboration model.",
