    category: "研討活動",
    title: "라온시큐어（RaonSecure）舉辦「2026 SecureUp & Hackathon」，提出基於 Agentic AI 的安全與 Web3 信任結構",
    summary: "라온시큐어（RaonSecure）宣布將於9月30日在首爾 Fairmont Ambassador舉行第14屆「2026 SecureUp & Hackathon」。本次活動以「讓 Agentic AI 變得有趣且安全」（Make Agentic AI Fun and Secure）為主題，旨在展示라온시큐어的 Agentic AI 安全願景與核心技術。\n\n在活動中，由李俊形（이순형）代表進行的主旨發表將提出 Agentic AI 所改變的安全範式，並公開無法僅靠人工智慧填補的「信任」設計方案。主要議程包括：△Agentic AI 的未來戰略與多層次 AI 整合陣容 △分散式身份認證（DID）標準化與 AI 擴展 △用於實際入侵可能性驗證的 Agentic AI 模擬滲透測試 △為強化大型語言模型（LLM）所應用的 AI Guardrail △基於後量子密碼學（PQC）的信任設計等多樣技術討論。\n\n라온시큐어強調，將 Web3 定位為 Agentic AI 時代的核心信任結構，並計畫透過連接追蹤數位身份及權限委託/執行紀錄的稽核追蹤系統，擴展至可驗證的環境。此外，活動還將同步進行利用行動身分證的「區塊鏈與 AI Hackathon」決賽。",
    tags: ["라온시큐어", "Agentic AI", "Web3", "DID", "LLM 보안", "PQC"],
    title_en: "RaonSecure to Host '2026 SecureUp & Hackathon,' Proposing Security and Web3 Trust Structures Based on Agentic AI",
    summary_en: "RaonSecure announced that it will hold the 14th '2026 SecureUp & Hackathon' on September 30th at the Fairmont Ambassador in Seoul. This event, themed 'Making Agentic AI Fun and Secure,' aims to showcase RaonSecure's vision and core technologies for Agentic AI security. During the event, a keynote presentation by Lee Soon-hyeong will introduce the security paradigm shift brought about by Agentic AI, and unveil 'trust' design solutions that cannot be filled solely by artificial intelligence. Key agenda items include: △The future strategy of Agentic AI and multi-layered AI integration lineup △Standardization of Decentralized Identity (DID) and AI expansion △Agentic AI simulation penetration testing for practical exploitability verification △AI Guardrails for enhancing Large Language Model (LLM) applications △Trust design based on Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC), among various technical discussions. RaonSecure emphasized positioning Web3 as the core trust structure of the Agentic AI era, planning to expand it into a verifiable environment by connecting audit tracking systems that track digital identities and delegated/executed permissions. Additionally, the event will simultaneously feature the finals of a 'Blockchain and AI Hackathon' utilizing mobile digital IDs.",
